--- /dev/null
+++ b/Misc/NEWS.d/next/Core_and_Builtins/2026-11-17-00-00-00.gh-issue-XXXXXX.tV-0C309.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+The parts of an exception group made by :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split`,
+:meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.subgroup` and :keyword:`except* <except_star>` now
+keep the :attr:`~BaseException.__suppress_context__` value of the original
+group. Previously it was always set, which hid the group's implicit
+:attr:`~BaseException.__context__` in tracebacks.
